OL,3,GNEWSACharity watchdog condemns abuse of
OL,4,ARNLI crews
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chair of the Charity Commission has
OL,7,Fcondemned the "thuggery and
OL,8,Fintimidation" faced by RNLI volunteers.
OL,10,FDame Julia Unwin said the lifeboat
OL,11,Fcharity, based in Poole, Dorset, had an
OL,12,F"absolute duty" to rescue people "in
OL,13,Fperil in the sea".
OL,15,FVolunteers have been targeted by
OL,16,Fprotesters since the RNLI helped bring
OL,17,Fabout 120 migrants ashore at Eastney,
OL,18,FPortsmouth, on 6 September, and police
OL,19,Fare investigating threats made to crews
OL,20,Fover radio during a rescue this month.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
